  "description": {
   "en": "A girl who can see emotions as \"light\" is reborn as an extra in a novel. Seeking peace, she settles in a forest hut, only to discover it’s the cursed territory of a feared duke. Uniquely able to calm his curse, she strikes a deal with him, but on one condition: he must take the form of a snow leopard when they’re together."
